return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T08:25:56+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T08:25:56+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Ka iibi Zinn Digital® martigelinta mareegtaada WordPress adiga oo adeegsanaya WordPress, WooCommerce, wakiil, reseller, cloud iyo VPS martigelin. Ka raadi oo bixi domain-yada koontadaada reseller, macaamiishaada si toos ah ugu gal liiska martigelinta, oo si toos ah u diyaari martigelinta marka la bixiyo amarka WooCommerce.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Madasha martigelinta waxay ku jawaabtay heerka %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Raadi magacaaga domain-ka','Search'=>'Raadi','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Magacaas lama hubin wax kordhin ah.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Raadinta domain-ka lagama heli karo boggan hadda.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Waqtigan xaadirka ah ma aanu gaari karin diiwaanka domain-ka. Fadlan isku day mar kale cabbaar yar kadib.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.'=>'Furaha API waa maqan yahay ama ma shaqeeyo. Ka hubi hoosta Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Furaha API-gan ma wado ogolaanshaha sites.view, ee ay raadinta domain-ku u baahan tahay. Ku dar furahaaga gudihiisa qaybtaada iibiyaha (reseller panel), ama halkaan ka tirtir furaha si aad ugu noqoto raadinta dadweynaha.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Maamulayaashu kaliya ayaa arka tan:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Midan ma hubin karno — mar kale isku day','Already registered'=>'Horay ayaa loo diiwaangeliyay','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Waa la heli karaa — naga codso qiime','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Waa la heli karaa — %1$s %2$s sanadka ugu horreeya','Register it'=>'Isku diiwaangeli','Manage my hosting'=>'Maaree martigelinta aan leeyahay','Please sign in first.'=>'Fadlan marka hore soo gal.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Akongigani wali lama xiriirin adeeg hosting ah.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Madal ah agabka martigelinta ma aysan soo celin xiriiriyaha saxiixa.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Qalabka Dib-u-iibiyaha','Account'=>'Koontada','Features'=>'Astaamaha','Styling'=>'Naqshadeynta','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakiillada AI (MCP)','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Oggolow wakiilada AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Dami: qalabka hoose iyo waddooyinkooda REST gabi ahaanba ma diiwaangashana.','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Koontadaada dib-u-iibiyaha ee Zinn Digital®','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Ku samee furaha API ee reseller-ka ah gudaha dashboard-kaaga Zinn® ee hoos yimaada Developer → API keys, oo ku dheji halkaan.','Reseller API key'=>'Furaha API ee xayeysiiyaha','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'Goobkan kaliya ayaa lagu hayaa, mana lagu daro dhoofinta ama warbixinta cilmibaarista.','Plan to provision'=>'Qorshaha la diyaarinayo','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Koodka qorshaha ee macaamiisha cusub la saarayo. Ka tag meel bannaan si laguweydiiyo mar kasta.','API address'=>'Cinwaanka API','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'Tan ha beddelin ilaa iyo intii ay taageerada Zinn® ay kaa codsato inaad beddesho.','Control-panel address'=>'Cinwaanka guddiga maamulka','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'Halku ay xiriirka "Martigelintayda" uu u dirayo macaamiishaada.','Domain search'=>'Raadinta domain-ka','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'Bixi calaamadda gaaban ee [zinn_domain_search]','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'Geli furaha gaaban (shortcode) bogag kasta si aad u ogolaato booqashooyinka inay hubiyaan domain oo ay adiga kaa iibsadaan.','Panel link'=>'Xiriiriyaha guddiga','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'Muuji xiriirka "Martigelkayga" macaamiisha soo galay','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'Diyaarinta WooCommerce','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'Si toos ah u bixi martigelinta marka dalbashada WooCommerce ay dhammaystiranto','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'Waxay ku dhaqangaddaa oo keliya dalabaadka ay ku jiraan badeecad aad ku xirtay qorshe Zinn® ah.','Domain search appearance'=>'Muuqaalka raadinta domain-ka','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'Qalabkan waxa uu ka dhex muuqdaa mowduucaaga (theme). Dooro qaab horay loo sii habeeyey, ama deji midabadaada — si kastaba ha ahaatee bogaggaaga laguma daro wax ay booqde u arki karo inay annaga na leeyihiin.','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'Fiiro kasta oo uu widget-ku isticmaalo waxaa lagu taxay readme-ga plugin-ka, si horumariye uu u tirtiro wax kasta oo uusan preset-ku daboolayn.','Follow my theme'=>'Raac mawduucayga','Soft'=>'Jilicsan','High contrast'=>'Iftiinka sare','Compact'=>'Cufan','Buy-link colour'=>'Midabka xiriirka iibsashada','“Available” colour'=>'Midabka la heli karo','“Could not check” colour'=>'Midabka “Lama hubin karo”','Error colour'=>'Midabka qaladka','Corner rounding'=>'Wareegga geesaha','Space inside each row'=>'Meel bannaan oo saf kasta dhexdiisa ah','Text size'=>'Cabirka qoraalka','Domain-name weight'=>'Miisaanka magaca domain-ka','No reseller API key yet.'=>'Weli ma jiro fure reseller API ah.','Domain search already works without one, at the public prices. The panel link and WooCommerce provisioning need a key: create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys.'=>'Raadinta domain-ka waxay horayba u shaqaysaa iyada oo aan mid lahayn, qiimaha dadweynaha. Xiriirinta guddiga iyo bixinta WooCommerce waxay u baahan yihiin furaha: mid ku samee dashboard-kaaga Zinn® hoos Developer → API keys.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Furo golaha kontoroolka ee Zinn®','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'Fure wa la dejiyay, laakiin waxba lama shidin.','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'Midkasta oo ka mid ah saddexda astaamood ma awoodo, markaa qalabkan dheeriga ahi wax shaqo ah kama qabto bartaada. Shid waxa aad u baahan tahay hoosta Astaamaha.','Open Features'=>'Fur Qoondayasha','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'Diyaar — %d muuuqaal ayaa la shiday.' . "\0" . 'Diyaar — %d astaamood waa la shaqaysiiyay.','Selling from'=>'Ka iibinaya','Settings'=>'Dejinta','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Weli furaha API ma jiro, markaa waxba kuma xirna.','Not connected: %s'=>'Lama xiriirin: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'Ku xiran. Barnaamijkaaga dib-u-iibiyaha waa %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Ma jiro fure Zinn® API ah oo loo habeeyey, markaa waxba lama bixin.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Dalabkani kuma uusan jirin magac domain ah, markaa ma jirin wax la bixiyo.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Goobaha martigelintu ma aysan soo celin degel.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'Adeegga martigelinta ee Zinn® ee loo qoondeeyey %1$s (adeegga %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Madasha martigelinta ma aysan soo celin koontada macaamiisha.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Zinn® hosting ma aanaysan: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Khadka badeecada ee Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Safafka badeecada ee Zinn® ee la bixinayo marka badeecadan la iibsado. Iskada banaan si aad u isticmaasho midka caadiga ah ee ka yimid dejinta qalabka dheeriga ah.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Zinn® hosting','Service id'=>'Aqoonsiga adeegga','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Waxba looma qoondeeyanin dalabkan.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Kaydsan. Ku qor qiime cusub si aad u bedesho.','Filter this list…'=>'Sifee liiskan…','Filter this list'=>'Miir liiskan','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Waxba kuma habboona miirahaas.','Add a row'=>'Ku dar saf','Remove this row'=>'Ka saar safkan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — dulmar guud','Overview'=>'Guud mar','Copied'=>'La nuqulaystay','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Plugin kasta oo Zinn® ah oo ku jira boggan, iyo inuu shaqeynayo iyo in kale.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Plugin-kaan uma baahna wax xiriir ah.','Open settings'=>'Fur dejinta','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ma haystotid fasax aad ku beddesho habayntan.','Settings sections'=>'Qaybaha dejinta','Support'=>'Taageero','Save changes'=>'Keydso isbeddellada','Tools'=>'Qalabka','Export settings'=>'Dhoofinta habaynta','Reset to defaults'=>'Dib ugu deji sida caadiga ah','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay soo celinaysaa dhammaan dejinta plugin-kan sidii ay asal ahaan ahayd. Ma rabtaa inaad sii waddo?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Baaritaanka taageerada','Import a settings file'=>'Soo dejiso faylka dejinta','Import'=>'Soo dejinta','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faylasha la dhoofiyay waligood kuma jiraan erayada sirta ah, summadaha ama furayaasha API-ga — waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad dib u geliso kuwaas mareegta cusub.','Settings saved.'=>'Dejinta waa la keydiyay.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Qorshe kasta oo ku jira furahan wuxuu ku noqday halkiisii ​​hore.','Done.'=>'La dhammeeyay.','That action is not available.'=>'Falalkaas ma jiro.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faylkaas lama akhrisan karo. Dooro faylka dejinta ee laga soo dhoofiyay Zinn® plugin.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Feylkaasi waa mid aad u weyn oo aan noqon karin dhoofinta dejinta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi ma aha dhoofinta dejinta Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Feylkaas waxaa laga soo dhoofiyay qalab kale oo wax lagu daro (%s), markaa keenista halkan waxay kaydinaysaa habayn uusan qalabkani fahmin.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d goobaha la soo dejiyey. Furayaasha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API-ga laguma daro dhoofinta, markaa dib u gali kuwaas.' . "\0" . '%d dejinta la soo dejiyey. Furayaasha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API-ga laguma daro dhoofinta, markaa fadlan mar kale gali kuwaas.','Connected'=>'Ku xidhan','Connecting…'=>'Wuxuu ku xidhayaa...','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ku xidhan, laakiin waxaa jira wax u baahan in la eego','Not connected'=>'Lama xiriirin','Running on your own account'=>'Ku shaqaynta akoonkaaga gaarka ah','We could not check this'=>'Waanu kari weynay in aan hubinno arrintan','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Kan plugin-ka ma uusan sheegin sababta. Dir warbixin ogaansho ah annagana waanu eegi doonaa.','Connection status'=>'Xaaladda xiriirka','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Waxaa la hubiyay %s kahor.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(waxaa lagu furayaa tab cusub)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'U dir tan taageerada Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Kani waa sida saxda ah ee la diri doono — wax kale ma jiraan, waxna ma qarsana. Furayaashaada sirta ah, calaamadaha aqoonsiga, iyo furayaasha API-ga kuma jiraan.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Warbixinta cilmibaarista ee la diri doono','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nuqul ka qaado sabuuradda','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Warbixintan u dir taageerada Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Waxaan kuu furnaa tigidh taageero ah oo aan iimayl kuugu soo jawaabnay. Haddii aadan jeclayn inaad dirto, kor ka soo guuri oo adigu ku dheji tigidh.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Kama soo gaari kareynay Zinn Digital® server-kan (%s) ka socota. Nuqul ka soo qaado warbixinta kor ku xusan oo halkaasoo furan tigidh — wax khalad ah oo ku jira habayntaada ma jiraan.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada waxaana ay kuugu soo jawaabi doonaan iime رمز.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay haysataa warbixintaada — tixraaca %s — waxayna kuugu jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Waxaad dirtay warbixinno dhawr ah muddo gaaban gudaheed. Sug daqiiqado yar oo dib u day — kuwii hore way yimaadeen.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma awoorin inay aqbasho warbixinta hadda — taasi waa dhankayaga, ee maaha dhankaaga. Mar kale isku day dhawaan, ama koobi ka dhig warbixinta sare oo geli tigidh.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Warbixinta waa la diiday (HTTP %d). Koobi garso kore oo fur tigidh, adigoo xiganaya lambarkaas.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhriso hagaha isticmaalaha ee %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Haye\'ynta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, gurmadyada maalinlaha ah, haajiridda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga maamulka ee loo dhisay dadka maamula in ka badan hal degel.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibsii oo iibi mareegaha, domaynada iyo meelaha xiriirinta ee la dhisay, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo haynayo ilaa inta labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan shaqadan u leh xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa caalamiga ah ee qandaraaslayaasha: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaarsan oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyeyaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u oggolow inay ku tartamaan.','Style preset'=>'Habka la sii diyaariyay','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Bilaabayaw. Wax kasta oo hooseeya ayaa ka sarreeya.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Isticmaal midabadayda iyo cabirradayda','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Tan ha kaga tag oo horay loo sii dejiyay waa sida uu yahay.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ayaan soo saarin xiriiriyaha soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in boggani uu gaari karo madal Zinn®, kadibna isku day mar labaad.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinlama soo dejisan karo adeegga cusboonaysiin ee Zinn® (%s). Iskey mar kale daqiiqado kadib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey ayaa ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka hufnaanta waxaana la rakibay.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Tallaabada lama dhameystiri karo. Dib u day, oo haddii ay sii wado inay guuldareysato, la xiriir maamulaha mareegta.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Qiيمه loo baahan yahay ayaa maqan ama qaab khaldan leh. Hubi jaantuska gelitaanka awoodda.','The site refused the request.'=>'Boggu wuu diiday codsiga.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'U oggolow caawiyeyaasha AI sida Claude, Cursor ama VS Code inay uga shaqeeyaan mareegtan adiga iyagoo adeegsanaya MCP (Model Context Protocol). Waxay u soo galaan sidii isticmaale WordPress ah oo wata erayga sirta ah ee codsiga waxayna samayn karaan oo kaliya waxa loo oggol yahay in isticmaalahaas uu sameeyo.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakiillada AI waxay u baahan yihiin WordPress 6.9 ama wixii ka dambeeya. Cusbooneysii WordPress si aad u isticmaasho.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirka (barta dhammaadka MCP)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Abuur erayga sirta ah ee codsiga isticmaalahaaga','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Tan ku dar jaangooyooyinka MCP ee abkaaga AI, adigoo isticmaalaya magacaaga isticmaale iyo eraygaas sirta ah:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: geli gelitaan la mid ah hoosta "servers" ee ku jira .vscode/mcp.json, ee ha ka hoos marin "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Aaladaha wakiilka AI uu isticmaali karo halkan (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha: Wakiilada AI iyo MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dukumentiyada horumariyaha: awoodaha, REST iyo MCP','Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site.'=>'Ka maamul macaamiishaada martigelinta, qorshayaashooda, iyo mareegahooda Zinn Digital® boggan.','Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account.'=>'Macmiishaada, qorshayaashooda iyo mareegahooda, adoo adeegsanaya koontadaada dib-u-iibiye ee Zinn Digital®.','Read your reseller account'=>'Akhri koontadaaga dib-u-iibiyaha','Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up.'=>'Wuxuu ku soo celiyaa koontadaada dib-u-iibiyaha hal akhris ah: astaanta, qorshayaasha, tirada macaamiisha iyo adeegyada, iyo waxa la habeeyay.','List your clients'=>'Liiska macaamiishaada','Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit).'=>'Waxay liis garaynaysaa akoonnada macmiilkaaga, hal bog markiiba (cursor, limit).','Create a client'=>'Abuur macmiil','Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site.'=>'Waxay abuurtaa akoon macmiil ah oo hoos yimaada kaaga (magaca; default_currency, koodh saddex xaraf ka kooban). Geli qorshe ka hor intaanay degelkooda ugu horreeya samayn.','Read a client\'s plan'=>'Akhriso qorshaha macaamiisha','Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id).'=>'Waxay soo celisaa qorshaha uu macaamiilku ku jiro iyo waxa uu kuugu kaco (client_id).','Put a client on a plan'=>'Geli macaamiil qorshe','Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site.'=>'Wuxuu macmiilka geliyaa mid ka mid ah qorshayaashaada (client_id, plan_code; interval: bisha ama sannadka). Samee tan ka hor inta aanu iman degelkooda ugu horreeya.','List the plans you can sell'=>'Liiska qorshayaasha aad iibin karto','Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it).'=>'Waxay taxaysaa qorshayaasha martigelinta iyo qiimahooda (product_line iyo currency ayaa cidhiidhinaya).','List your clients\' sites'=>'Liis garee mareegaha macaamiishaada','Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time.'=>'Waxay liis garaynaysaa wax kasta oo aad u diyaarisay macaamiishaada (client_id iyo status ayaa soo koobaya), hal bog markiiba.','Create a site for a client'=>'Abuur degel macaamiil','Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client\'s plan, as from your shop.'=>'Wuxuu u abuurayaa degel martigelisay mid ka mid ah macaamiishaada (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). Waxaa lagugu billayaa xisaabtaada qorshaha macmiilka, sida dukaankaaga laga soo bilaabo.','Suspend a client\'s site'=>'Jooji bogga macmiilka','Puts a client\'s site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended.'=>'Waxay gelisaa bogga macmiilka xayiraad aan la bixin awgeed (site_id; sababta: qoraalkaaga gaarka ah, oo aan weli loo muujin macmiilka). Boggu wuxuu joojiyaa adeegga illaa laga saarayo xayiraadda.','Unsuspend a client\'s site'=>'Ka qaad xayiraadda mareegta macmiilka','Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id).'=>'Wuxuu qaadaa xayiraadda bixinta la\'aanta, si ay boggu mar labaad u shaqeeyo (site_id).','Read the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Akhriso habaynta Qalabka Adeegga Dib-u-iibiyaha','Returns this plugin\'s settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa dejinta qalabkan (cinwaanka API-ga, qorshaha ay dalabyada cusub isticmaalaan, sifooyinka shaqaynaya). Furaha API-ga waligiis lama soo celiyo, kaliya midbaa la keydiyay.','Change the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Beddel dejinta Qalabka dib-u-iibiyaha','Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only.'=>'Waxay bedeshaa dejinta aad dirto (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) oo waxay haysaa inta kale. Furaha API-ga iyo cinwaanka waxaa lagu beddelaa shaashadda kaliya.','Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first.'=>'Markabkaaga API ee dib-u-iibiyaha Zinn Digital® ku dar shaashadda Aaladda Dib-u-iibiyaha marka hore.']];